# Zeitlos -- slide, in about 45 seconds: for a short video.
#
#   > run automate /data/automate/slide.zds
#
# Revision 1. Shows sw/apps/slide (docs/slide_app.md): a flowchart drawn
# live with connectors that follow their shapes, the deck shown full
# screen with its transitions, Scheme in the message box, and a deck
# that is an app (the calculator example). The deck is
# /data/automate/slide_demo.zsl; the demo adds a card to it and never
# saves it.
#
# Every step here is also run on the build machine, at the same
# coordinates: make -C sw/apps/slide render (tests/render_ui.c, "what
# sw/data/demo/slide.zds does"), so a change to slide that would make
# the demo miss fails there first.
#
# THE RULE (docs/demo.md): speech and action never overlap.

reset
interruptible off
caption-size 3
caption-pos bottom
rate 190
type-speed 60
speech on
voice recorded

# -- 1. a deck ---------------------------------------------------------
# The window is 548x384 inside: the card at (30, 6) at 100%.
run slide /data/automate/slide_demo.zsl at 40 20
origin slide
pause 600
narrate slide: cards, slides and apps | This is slide. Cards, slides, and apps.

# -- 2. a flowchart, drawn live ----------------------------------------
narrate Draw a flowchart | Draw a flow chart.
key ctrl+m
key v
key /
type pill Start
key enter
drag 286 177 120 66 500
key /
type diamond Ready?
key enter
key /
type fill 2
key enter
key /
type cylinder Saved
key enter
drag 286 177 450 276 500
# the arrow tool, from shape to shape: connected
key a
drag 120 66 286 177 600
drag 286 177 450 276 600
key v
pause 300
narrate Connectors follow | And the arrows follow their shapes.
drag 286 177 330 120 900
pause 300
drag 450 276 400 250 700
pause 400
key esc
key /
type transition iris 600
key enter

# -- 3. the show -------------------------------------------------------
narrate Show it, full screen | Show it, full screen.
key shift+f5
pause 1500
key space
pause 1800
key space
pause 1800
key space
pause 1800
key space
pause 1800
key esc
pause 400

# -- 4. Scheme, at once ------------------------------------------------
narrate Scheme inside | With scheme inside.
key /
type (* 6 7)
key enter
pause 1500

# -- 5. a deck as an app -----------------------------------------------
# The demo's changes are not saved: kill, not close (no "Save first?").
kill slide
narrate Decks become apps | And a deck can be an app.
run slide /data/slide/examples/calculator.zsl at 64 40
origin slide
pause 500
click 163 232
click 225 232
click 349 176
pause 200
click 287 232
click 163 176
click 287 288
pause 1500
kill slide

# -- 6. the end --------------------------------------------------------
origin screen
caption github.com/machdyne/zeitlos
say Zeitlos. Time less cum pewting.
pause 1200
caption-off
reset
end
